# Visual-regression snapshots (TEST-03, GAP-FULL-REVIEW-2026-08-25).
# The capture step (`pnpm test:visual:update`) writes portable PNG
# baselines into `tests/e2e/visual-regression.spec.ts-snapshots/` under
# `reference/` and `responsive/`. With the portable
# `snapshotPathTemplate` in playwright.config.ts the filenames no
# longer embed the worktree path or the host OS, so the baselines are
# committed and serve as the assert-mode gate. The previous exclusion
# was removed so the first capture run can seed the baselines.
#
# Anything that lands in the snapshots dir but is NOT under
# `reference/` or `responsive/` (e.g. old `-darwin.png` leftovers from
# previous worktree captures) is still ignored — it would be a stale
# capture, not a baseline.
tests/e2e/visual-regression.spec.ts-snapshots/*
!tests/e2e/visual-regression.spec.ts-snapshots/reference/
!tests/e2e/visual-regression.spec.ts-snapshots/responsive/

