# CodeGraph (https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph) — local SQLite
# knowledge graph for AI agents. Filenames embed absolute paths and the host
# OS, so the index is not portable. Rebuild with `pnpm codegraph:init`.
.codegraph/

# Superpowers brainstorming sessions — local interactive design artifacts.
.superpowers/
